  "description": "Opt-in Roslyn rules for code that builds on Trax .NET, and for any other .NET code: about 250 checks for culture and comparer bugs, async and cancellation mistakes, regex timeouts, null-forgiving operators and more, plus bans on reading the clock, chance or the console. Every rule is an error by default; turn one off in .editorconfig, or switch a group off with an MSBuild property.",
